{"id":"CVE-2019-19962","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2019-12-24T23:03:39.000Z","updated":"2024-08-05T02:32:10.116Z","description":"wolfSSL before 4.3.0 mishandles calls to wc_SignatureGenerateHash, leading to fault injection in RSA cryptography.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/releases/tag/v4.3.0-stable","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/commit/23878512c65834d12811b1107d19a001478eca5d","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]}],"vendors":["crypto-libs"]}
{"id":"CVE-2019-19963","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2019-12-24T23:03:26.000Z","updated":"2024-08-05T02:32:10.056Z","description":"An issue was discovered in wolfSSL before 4.3.0 in a non-default configuration where DSA is enabled. DSA signing uses the BEEA algorithm during modular inversion of the nonce, leading to a side-channel attack against the nonce.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/releases/tag/v4.3.0-stable","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/commit/7e391f0fd57f2ef375b1174d752a56ce34b2b190","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]}],"vendors":["crypto-libs"]}
